 result←object selection arg;new;old
 old←object ⎕VGET⊂'_selection'⍬
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←old
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: selection'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt new←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: selection'##.##.Error 1<≢⍴new
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: selection'##.##.Error~0 2∊⍨≢new
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: selection'##.##.Error>/new
     object._selection←new
     :If 32∊##.##.BitVals object ⎕VGET⊂'_style' 0
         object ##.##.∆WS'SelRange'new
     :Else
         object ##.##.∆WS'SelRange' ¯1 ¯1 ⍝? Should we leave this alone in case Style gets changed back (in the future)?
     :EndIf
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
